#: ../../source/gifsicle_readme.md:3
msgid ""
"gifsicle manipulates GIF image files in many different ways. Depending on"
" command line options, it can merge several GIFs into a GIF animation; "
"explode an animation into its component frames; change individual frames "
"in an animation; turn interlacing on and off; add transparency and much "
"more."
msgstr ""

